msgstr "Détection des logos"

#: crates/sumi-gui/qml/OledCarePage.qml:53
msgid ""
"Spots bright logos and HUD elements that don't move and lowers their "
"brightness."
msgstr ""
"Repère les logos lumineux et les éléments de HUD immobiles et réduit leur "
"luminosité."

